IL-specific: probes the ToString recursion guard
(RuntimeHelpers.TryEnsureSufficientExecutionStack) emitted by the IL
backend's EmitToString. Other backends either lack the guard or use
a different codegen strategy for user-defined sum/record types, so
the 10000-deep `show` traversal doesn't survive without an explicit
guard. Runs only under --compiler=il via
samples/_il/record-cycle.expected.
